note <the console's parse, usage and help over a literal route table read the same on node and Rust>

# Item term-self-host-001-1119, decision 138 rule 1 of term/self-host/change/001-finish-self-host: the host-free
# dispatcher's closure is native. work/hook/route-parsing.tree read JavaScript's own behavior through `case node` binds
# (Number() of a word, padEnd and length in UTF-16 units, JSON's quoting, a record's key order), so its closure did not
# build on Rust, and work/help.tree's quoting and width did the same. They are plain Term or calls into @term/base now.
# One program builds a literal route table in the plain form (work/hook/route.tree: the 0160 probe's two routes, a
# choices take, an alias, a variadic slot, a masked take, a float take, a maybe take, a non-ASCII take and an astral
# command path) and prints the program's usage, each command's help, work/help.tree's `--help` text for the program and
# each command, and the parse of fixed command lines: each route, `--help`, a command's `--help`, an unknown command, a missing
# slot, numbers Number() reads oddly ('', ' 2 ', '0x10', '1e3', '-0x10', a hex past 53 bits), a bad choice, an unknown
# flag of an astral letter (two dashes by UTF-16 length) and two unknown flags in a record's key order. The answer below
# is what the original binds printed on node (item 1118's draft, before this item), and TypeScript and Rust must print
# it byte for byte. The program resolves from the CLI's own package, deck/call, read lean as a project build reads it.
#
# Item term-self-host-001-1120, decision 138 rule 1 (and item 1159): work/hook/running.tree split into a host-free
# decision (work/hook/deciding.tree `decide`: the argv as a list of text, the routes, the shown name and the mark, to
# an outcome whose every line is written out, a refusal as its usage-ask that the run draws in the view it reads then,
# decision 149, item 1273) and node's thin run of it.
# A second program decides fixed command lines over a route table (a program flag, a command whose parameters are
# recorded out of its takes' order, a maybe take, a group with no task, a command bound to nothing, a float take, a
# required flag) with a mark and without: help asked for, a bare line, the version, an unknown command with and without
# a near one, a missing required take, a parse error, a group, a passing `--`, each call's handed values, a console
# that words its own refusal, and term's refusal (work/hook/refusal.tree) in color, truecolor, a nested run, the JSON
# log, sentences and CI annotations, from a view holding no host read, each closed 1,234 ms after it opened
# (`refusal-closed`). The answer is node's (the draft of the item), and node's run of the same code prints term's own
# refusals and a booted console's byte for byte as the printer did (tmp/self-host/1118/capture.mjs,
# tmp/self-host/1120/boot-views.mjs, every view). TypeScript and Rust must print it byte for byte.

load ../support/compiling
  find compile-choice

load ../support/running
  find run-text

load @term/base/test/temp
  find temp-folder

load @term/base/process/tool
  find find-tool

host program, <load @term/call/work/hook/route\n  find route\n  find route-take\n  find route-literal\n\nload @term/call/work/hook/route-parsing\n  find parse-line\n  find render-route-help\n  find render-route-usage\n  find parsed-line\n  find line-arg\n  find arg-value\n  find usage-refusal\n\nload @term/call/work/help\n  find help-text\n\nload @term/base/list\n  find join\n\nload @term/base/float\n  find is-finite\n\nload @term/base/maybe\n  find maybe\n  find some\n  find none\n\ntask take-of\n  take name, like text\n  take kind, like text\n  take note, like text\n  like route-take\n  back make(route-take, bind(name, name), bind(kind, kind), bind(item-kind, \<\>), bind(optional, false), bind(required, false), bind(short, \<\>), bind(aliases, make list), bind(masked, false), bind(note, note), bind(fallback, make none), bind(variadic, false), bind(positional, false), bind(passes, false), bind(choices, make list))\n\ntask route-of\n  take path, like text\n  take note, like text\n  take takes, like list, like route-take\n  take children, like list, like route\n  take task-name, like text\n  like route\n  back make(route, bind(path, path), bind(note, note), bind(takes, takes), bind(task-name, task-name), bind(params, make list), bind(params-given, false), bind(passes, false), bind(children, children))\n\ntask routes-of\n  like list, like route\n  save quiet, take-of(\<quiet\>, \<boolean\>, \<Print less\>)\n  save quiet/short, \<q\>\n  save who, take-of(\<name\>, \<string\>, \<who to greet\>)\n  save who/required, true\n  save who/positional, true\n  save times, take-of(\<times\>, \<number\>, \<how many times\>)\n  save once, make(literal-number, bind(value, 1))\n  save times/fallback, make(some, once)\n  save repeat, make list\n  repeat/push \<repeat\>\n  save times/aliases, repeat\n  save mode, take-of(\<mode\>, \<string\>, \<how fast\>)\n  save speeds, make list\n  speeds/push \<fast\>\n  speeds/push \<slow\>\n  save mode/choices, speeds\n  save greeting, take-of(\<greeting\>, \<string\>, \<what to say\>)\n  save said, make(literal-text, bind(value, \<hi "you" \\\\ ok\>))\n  save greeting/fallback, make(some, said)\n  save secret, take-of(\<secret\>, \<string\>, \<a key\>)\n  save secret/masked, true\n  save ratio, take-of(\<ratio\>, \<float\>, \<how much\>)\n  save level, take-of(\<level\>, \<named\>, \<how deep\>)\n  save level/optional, true\n  save level/item-kind, \<number\>\n  save wide, take-of(\<größe\>, \<string\>, \<a size\>)\n  save greet-takes, make list\n  greet-takes/push who\n  greet-takes/push times\n  greet-takes/push mode\n  greet-takes/push greeting\n  greet-takes/push secret\n  greet-takes/push ratio\n  greet-takes/push level\n  greet-takes/push wide\n  save words, take-of(\<words\>, \<array\>, \<the words\>)\n  save words/positional, true\n  save words/variadic, true\n  save count-takes, make list\n  count-takes/push words\n  save none-takes, make list\n  save no-children, make list\n  save commands, make list\n  commands/push route-of(\<greet\>, \<Greet someone\>, greet-takes, no-children, \<greet\>)\n  commands/push route-of(\<count\>, \<Count words\>, count-takes, no-children, \<count\>)\n  commands/push route-of(\<𝔸rt\>, \<An astral path, two UTF-16 units in one\>, none-takes, no-children, \<astral\>)\n  save program-takes, make list\n  program-takes/push quiet\n  save routes, make list\n  routes/push route-of(\<tool\>, \<The tool\>, program-takes, commands, \<\>)\n  back routes\n\ntask value-shown\n  take value, like arg-value\n  like text\n  sift value\n    case arg-text\n      link given\n      back \<text \{given\}\>\n    case arg-flag\n      link on\n      back \<flag \{on\}\>\n    case arg-number\n      link amount\n      back \<number \{amount\}\>\n    case arg-decimal\n      link fraction\n      fork test, is-finite(fraction)\n        hold\n          back \<number \{fraction\}\>\n      back \<number Infinity\>\n    case arg-list\n      link items\n      back \<list \{join(items, \<,\>)\}\>\n\ntask args-shown\n  take args, like list, like line-arg\n  like text\n  save out, make list\n  walk args\n    take one\n    out/push \<\{one/name\}=\{value-shown(one/value)\}\>\n  back join(out, \<; \>)\n\ntask refusal-shown\n  take refusal, like maybe, like usage-refusal\n  like text\n  sift refusal\n    case some\n      link held\n      sift held\n        case choice\n          link refused\n          save out, make list\n          walk refused\n            take one\n            out/push \<\{one/take\}:\{one/given\}\>\n          back \<choice \{join(out, \<,\>)\}\>\n        case missing\n          link got\n          link need\n          link takes\n          back \<missing \{got\}/\{need\} \{join(takes, \<,\>)\}\>\n        case other\n          link said\n          back \<other\>\n    case none\n      back \<none\>\n\ntask parsed-shown\n  take line, like parsed-line\n  like text\n  back \<ok \{line/ok\} | error \{line/error\} | command \{join(line/command, \< \>)\} | called \{line/called\} | args \{args-shown(line/args)\} | globals \{args-shown(line/globals)\} | refusal \{refusal-shown(line/refusal)\}\>\n\ntask case-of\n  take routes, like list, like route\n  take words, like list, like text\n  like text\n  back \<[\{join(words, \<][\>)\}] \{parsed-shown(parse-line(routes, words))\}\>\n\ntask run\n  like text\n  save routes, routes-of()\n  save lines, make list\n  lines/push render-route-usage(\<tool\>, routes/0/children)\n  walk routes/0/children\n    take one\n    lines/push render-route-help(one, \<tool\>)\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list)\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--times\>, \<0x10\>, \<-q\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--times\>, \<1e3\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--times=\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--times\>, \< 2 \>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--times\>, \<1.5\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--times\>, \<-0x10\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--times\>, \<0x20000000000001\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--mode\>, \<medium\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--mode\>, \<slow\>, \<--repeat\>, \<3\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<count\>, \<a\>, \<b\>, \<c\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<frobnicate\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<--help\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<--help\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<-𝔸\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--zeta\>, \<-2\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--ratio\>, \<.5\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--ratio\>, \<Infinity\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--ratio\>, \<1e3\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--ratio\>, \<1_0\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--no-quiet\>, \<--level\>, \<7\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--secret\>, \<s3cr3t\>, \<--größe\>, \<xl\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<𝔸rt\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--times=-0x10\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--times=0b101\>, \<--ratio=0o17\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--times= 0x1fffffffffffff　\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--ratio=-.5e1\>, \<--times=+12\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--ratio=.\>, \<--times=1e\>))\n  save top, routes/0\n  lines/push help-text(\<tool\>, \<\>, top/takes, top/children, make list)\n  lines/push help-text(\<tool\>, \<tool \\\<command\\\> 𝔸\>, top/takes, top/children, make list(\<greet\>))\n  lines/push help-text(\<tool\>, \<\>, top/takes, top/children, make list(\<count\>))\n  lines/push help-text(\<tool\>, \<\>, top/takes, top/children, make list(\<𝔸rt\>))\n  lines/push help-text(\<tool\>, \<\>, top/takes, top/children, make list(\<nope\>))\n  back join(lines, \<\\n\>)\n>

host wanted, <usage: tool \<command\> [options]\n\ncommands:\n  greet                  Greet someone\n  count                  Count words\n  𝔸rt                   An astral path, two UTF-16 units in one\n\nrun `tool \<command\> --help` for a command's options\ntool greet - Greet someone\n\noptions:\n  --name                 who to greet  (string, required)\n  --times                how many times  (number, default 1)\n  --mode                 how fast  (string, one of fast|slow)\n  --greeting             what to say  (string, default "hi \\"you\\" \\\\ ok")\n  --secret               a key  (string)\n  --ratio                how much  (float)\n  --level                how deep  (number)\n  --größe                a size  (string)\ntool count - Count words\n\noptions:\n  --words                the words  (array, variadic)\ntool 𝔸rt - An astral path, two UTF-16 units in one\n[] ok false | error no command given | command  | called  | args  | globals  | refusal other\n[greet][bob] ok true | error  | command greet | called greet | args name=text bob; times=number 1; greeting=text hi "you" \\ ok | globals  | refusal none\n[greet][bob][--times][0x10][-q] ok true | error  | command greet | called greet | args times=number 16; name=text bob; greeting=text hi "you" \\ ok | globals quiet=flag true | refusal none\n[greet][bob][--times][1e3] ok true | error  | command greet | called greet | args times=number 1000; name=text bob; greeting=text hi "you" \\ ok | globals  | refusal none\n[greet][bob][--times=] ok false | error --times takes a whole number, not "" | command greet | called  | args  | globals  | refusal other\n[greet][bob][--times][ 2 ] ok true | error  | command greet | called greet | args times=number 2; name=text bob; greeting=text hi "you" \\ ok | globals  | refusal none\n[greet][bob][--times][1.5] ok false | error --times takes a whole number, not "1.5" | command greet | called  | args  | globals  | refusal other\n[greet][bob][--times][-0x10] ok false | error unknown flag "--0x10". The flags are --name, --times, --mode, --greeting, --secret, --ratio, --level, --größe | command greet | called  | args  | globals  | refusal other\n[greet][bob][--times][0x20000000000001] ok true | error  | command greet | called greet | args times=number 9007199254740992; name=text bob; greeting=text hi "you" \\ ok | globals  | refusal none\n[greet][bob][--mode][medium] ok false | error --mode must be one of: fast, slow (got "medium") | command greet | called  | args  | globals  | refusal choice mode:medium\n[greet][bob][--mode][slow][--repeat][3] ok true | error  | command greet | called greet | args mode=text slow; times=number 3; name=text bob; greeting=text hi "you" \\ ok | globals  | refusal none\n[greet] ok true | error  | command greet | called greet | args times=number 1; greeting=text hi "you" \\ ok | globals  | refusal none\n[count][a][b][c] ok true | error  | command count | called count | args words=list a,b,c | globals  | refusal none\n[frobnicate] ok false | error unknown command "frobnicate" | command  | called  | args  | globals  | refusal other\n[--help] ok false | error unknown command "--help" | command  | called  | args  | globals  | refusal other\n[greet][--help] ok false | error unknown flag "--help". The flags are --name, --times, --mode, --greeting, --secret, --ratio, --level, --größe | command greet | called  | args  | globals  | refusal other\n[greet][bob][-𝔸] ok false | error unknown flag "--𝔸". The flags are --name, --times, --mode, --greeting, --secret, --ratio, --level, --größe | command greet | called  | args  | globals  | refusal other\n[greet][bob][--zeta][-2] ok false | error unknown flag "-2". The flags are --name, --times, --mode, --greeting, --secret, --ratio, --level, --größe | command greet | called  | args  | globals  | refusal other\n[greet][bob][--ratio][.5] ok true | error  | command greet | called greet | args ratio=number 0.5; name=text bob; times=number 1; greeting=text hi "you" \\ ok | globals  | refusal none\n[greet][bob][--ratio][Infinity] ok true | error  | command greet | called greet | args ratio=number Infinity; name=text bob; times=number 1; greeting=text hi "you" \\ ok | globals  | refusal none\n[greet][bob][--ratio][1e3] ok true | error  | command greet | called greet | args ratio=number 1000; name=text bob; times=number 1; greeting=text hi "you" \\ ok | globals  | refusal none\n[greet][bob][--ratio][1_0] ok false | error --ratio takes a number, not "1_0" | command greet | called  | args  | globals  | refusal other\n[greet][bob][--no-quiet][--level][7] ok true | error  | command greet | called greet | args level=number 7; name=text bob; times=number 1; greeting=text hi "you" \\ ok | globals quiet=flag false | refusal none\n[greet][bob][--secret][s3cr3t][--größe][xl] ok true | error  | command greet | called greet | args secret=text s3cr3t; größe=text xl; name=text bob; times=number 1; greeting=text hi "you" \\ ok | globals  | refusal none\n[𝔸rt] ok true | error  | command 𝔸rt | called astral | args  | globals  | refusal none\n[greet][bob][--times=-0x10] ok false | error --times takes a whole number, not "-0x10" | command greet | called  | args  | globals  | refusal other\n[greet][bob][--times=0b101][--ratio=0o17] ok true | error  | command greet | called greet | args times=number 5; ratio=number 15; name=text bob; greeting=text hi "you" \\ ok | globals  | refusal none\n[greet][bob][--times= 0x1fffffffffffff　] ok true | error  | command greet | called greet | args times=number 9007199254740991; name=text bob; greeting=text hi "you" \\ ok | globals  | refusal none\n[greet][bob][--ratio=-.5e1][--times=+12] ok true | error  | command greet | called greet | args ratio=number -5; times=number 12; name=text bob; greeting=text hi "you" \\ ok | globals  | refusal none\n[greet][bob][--ratio=.][--times=1e] ok false | error --times takes a whole number, not "1e" | command greet | called  | args  | globals  | refusal other\ntool [command]\n\nCommands:\n  tool greet \<name\>     Greet someone\n  tool count [words..]  Count words\n  tool 𝔸rt              An astral path, two UTF-16 units in one\n\nOptions:\n  -q, --quiet  Print less                                              [boolean]\ntool greet \<name\>\n\nGreet someone\n\nPositionals:\n  name  who to greet                                         [string] [required]\n\nOptions:\n  -q, --quiet            Print less                                    [boolean]\n      --times, --repeat  how many times                    [number] [default: 1]\n      --mode             how fast             [string] [choices: "fast", "slow"]\n      --greeting         what to say         [string] [default: "hi "you" \\ ok"]\n      --secret           a key                                          [string]\n      --ratio            how much                                       [number]\n      --level            how deep                                       [number]\n      --größe            a size                                         [string]\ntool count [words..]\n\nCount words\n\nPositionals:\n  words  the words                                         [array] [default: []]\n\nOptions:\n  -q, --quiet  Print less                                              [boolean]\ntool 𝔸rt\n\nAn astral path, two UTF-16 units in one\n\nOptions:\n  -q, --quiet  Print less                                              [boolean]\ntool [command]\n\nCommands:\n  tool greet \<name\>     Greet someone\n  tool count [words..]  Count words\n  tool 𝔸rt              An astral path, two UTF-16 units in one\n\nOptions:\n  -q, --quiet  Print less                                              [boolean]>

task choice
  like compile-choice

  back make(compile-choice, bind(project, <deck/call>), bind(project-lean, true))

test <TypeScript reads the lines as the original binds did>
  host folder, temp-folder(<hook-dispatch-native->)
  host ran, run-text(program, <typescript>, folder, <dispatch>, choice())
  want hold, is-equal(ran/reason, <>)
  want hold, is-equal(ran/output, wanted)

test <Rust reads the lines the same>
  fork test, is-equal(find-tool(<rustc>), <>)
    hold
      skip <rustc is not installed>
  host folder, temp-folder(<hook-dispatch-native->)
  host ran, run-text(program, <rust>, folder, <dispatch>, choice())
  want hold, is-equal(ran/reason, <>)
  want hold, is-equal(ran/output, wanted)

host deciding, <load @term/call/work/hook/route\n  find route\n  find route-take\n  find route-literal\n\nload @term/call/work/hook/route-parsing\n  find arg-value\n  find usage-refusal\n\nload @term/call/work/hook/refusal\n  find refusal-view\n  find refusal-said\n  find refusal-closed\n  find said\n\nload @term/call/work/hook/deciding\n  find decide\n  find line-ask\n  find outcome\n  find handed\n\nload @term/call/work/item/emit\n  find output\n\nload @term/call/work/item/setting\n  find style\n\nload @term/call/work/item/layout\n  find make-room\n\nload @term/call/work/item/paint\n  find make-palette\n\nload @term/call/work/item/run\n  find run-options\n\nload @term/call/work/item/standard\n  find make-standard\n\nload @term/base/list\n  find join\n\nload @term/base/text\n  find replace-all\n\nload @term/base/maybe\n  find maybe\n  find some\n  find none\n\ntask take-of\n  take name, like text\n  take kind, like text\n  take note, like text\n  like route-take\n  back make(route-take, bind(name, name), bind(kind, kind), bind(item-kind, \<\>), bind(optional, false), bind(required, false), bind(short, \<\>), bind(aliases, make list), bind(masked, false), bind(note, note), bind(fallback, make none), bind(variadic, false), bind(positional, false), bind(passes, false), bind(choices, make list))\n\ntask route-of\n  take path, like text\n  take note, like text\n  take takes, like list, like route-take\n  take children, like list, like route\n  take task-name, like text\n  like route\n  back make(route, bind(path, path), bind(note, note), bind(takes, takes), bind(task-name, task-name), bind(params, make list), bind(params-given, false), bind(passes, false), bind(children, children))\n\ntask routes-of\n  like list, like route\n  save quiet, take-of(\<quiet\>, \<boolean\>, \<Print less\>)\n  save quiet/short, \<q\>\n  save who, take-of(\<name\>, \<string\>, \<who to greet\>)\n  save who/required, true\n  save who/positional, true\n  save times, take-of(\<times\>, \<number\>, \<how many times\>)\n  save once, make(literal-number, bind(value, 1))\n  save times/fallback, make(some, once)\n  save level, take-of(\<level\>, \<named\>, \<how deep\>)\n  save level/optional, true\n  save level/item-kind, \<number\>\n  save loud, take-of(\<loud\>, \<boolean\>, \<\>)\n  save tag, take-of(\<tag\>, \<string\>, \<a tag\>)\n  save tag/required, true\n  save greet-takes, make list\n  greet-takes/push who\n  greet-takes/push times\n  greet-takes/push level\n  greet-takes/push loud\n  save words, take-of(\<words\>, \<array\>, \<the words\>)\n  save words/positional, true\n  save words/variadic, true\n  save count-takes, make list\n  count-takes/push words\n  save ratio, take-of(\<ratio\>, \<float\>, \<how much\>)\n  save label, take-of(\<label\>, \<string\>, \<\>)\n  save pair-takes, make list\n  pair-takes/push ratio\n  pair-takes/push label\n  pair-takes/push tag\n  save x, take-of(\<x\>, \<string\>, \<an x\>)\n  save inner-takes, make list\n  inner-takes/push x\n  save none-takes, make list\n  save no-children, make list\n  save inner, make list\n  inner/push route-of(\<inner\>, \<Inside\>, inner-takes, no-children, \<inner\>)\n  save greet, route-of(\<greet\>, \<Greet someone\>, greet-takes, no-children, \<greet\>)\n  save order, make list\n  order/push \<level\>\n  order/push \<name\>\n  order/push \<spare\>\n  order/push \<loud\>\n  save greet/params, order\n  save greet/params-given, true\n  save commands, make list\n  commands/push greet\n  commands/push route-of(\<count\>, \<Count words\>, count-takes, no-children, \<count\>)\n  commands/push route-of(\<pair\>, \<Two takes\>, pair-takes, no-children, \<pair\>)\n  commands/push route-of(\<box\>, \<A group\>, none-takes, inner, \<\>)\n  commands/push route-of(\<hollow\>, \<Nothing bound\>, none-takes, no-children, \<\>)\n  save program-takes, make list\n  program-takes/push quiet\n  save routes, make list\n  routes/push route-of(\<tool\>, \<The tool\>, program-takes, commands, \<\>)\n  back routes\n\ntask value-shown\n  take value, like arg-value\n  like text\n  sift value\n    case arg-text\n      link given\n      back \<text \{given\}\>\n    case arg-flag\n      link on\n      back \<flag \{on\}\>\n    case arg-number\n      link amount\n      back \<number \{amount\}\>\n    case arg-decimal\n      link fraction\n      back \<decimal \{fraction\}\>\n    case arg-list\n      link items\n      back \<list [\{join(items, \<,\>)\}]\>\n\ntask handed-shown\n  take one, like handed\n  like text\n  sift one\n    case handed-plain\n      link given\n      back value-shown(given)\n    case handed-some\n      link given\n      back \<some \{value-shown(given)\}\>\n    case handed-none\n      back \<none\>\n\ntask refusal-shown\n  take refusal, like maybe, like usage-refusal\n  like text\n  sift refusal\n    case some\n      link held\n      sift held\n        case choice\n          link refused\n          save out, make list\n          walk refused\n            take one\n            out/push \<\{one/take\}:\{one/given\}\>\n          back \<choice \{join(out, \<,\>)\}\>\n        case missing\n          link got\n          link need\n          link takes\n          back \<missing \{got\}/\{need\} \{join(takes, \<,\>)\}\>\n        case other\n          back \<other\>\n    case none\n      back \<none\>\n\ntask said-shown\n  take one, like said\n  like text\n  sift one\n    case said-line\n      link stream\n      link line\n      back \<line \{stream\}: \{line\}\>\n    case said-raw\n      link stream\n      link written\n      back \<raw \{stream\}: \{replace-all(written, \<\\e\>, \<^[\>)\}\>\n\ntask outcome-shown\n  take decided, like outcome\n  take view, like refusal-view\n  like text\n  sift decided\n    case outcome-said\n      link writes\n      link code\n      save out, make list\n      walk writes\n        take one\n        out/push said-shown(one)\n      back \<said \{code\} (\{writes/length\})\\n\{join(out, \<\\n\>)\}\>\n    case outcome-refuse\n      link usage\n      # the run draws the refusal in the view it reads then (decision 149)\n      save drawn, refusal-said(usage, view)\n      save writes, drawn/writes\n      save closing, drawn/closing\n      save out, make list\n      walk writes\n        take one\n        out/push said-shown(one)\n      # the run closes 1,234 ms after it opened\n      save closed, refusal-closed(closing, add(closing/started, 1234))\n      walk closed/writes\n        take one\n        out/push said-shown(one)\n      back \<refuse \{closed/code\} (\{writes/length\}+\{closed/writes/length\})\\n\{join(out, \<\\n\>)\}\>\n    case outcome-hand\n      link refusal\n      back \<hand \{refusal-shown(make(some, refusal))\}\>\n    case outcome-call\n      link task-name\n      link values\n      save out, make list\n      walk values\n        take one\n        out/push handed-shown(one)\n      back \<call \{task-name\} (\{join(out, \<; \>)\})\>\n\n# a refusal view with no host read in it: an 80-cell room at UTC+0, a fixed clock, home and working folder, and the\n# style, nesting and view flags given\ntask view-of\n  take depth, like text\n  take annotate, like boolean\n  take nest, like number\n  take json, like boolean\n  take plain, like boolean\n  like refusal-view\n  save rules, make-standard()\n  save chosen, make(style, bind(depth, depth), bind(theme, \<unknown\>), bind(ascii, false), bind(links, false), bind(live, false), bind(annotate, annotate))\n  save room, make-room(80, rules, false, 0, false)\n  save palette, make-palette(depth, \<unknown\>, false)\n  save options, make(run-options, bind(depth, nest), bind(json, json), bind(plain, plain))\n  save shown, make(output, bind(style, chosen), bind(room, room), bind(palette, palette), bind(options, options))\n  back make(refusal-view, bind(output, shown), bind(home, \</home/me\>), bind(root, \</home/me/work\>), bind(clock, 1700000000000))\n\ntask plain-view\n  like refusal-view\n  back view-of(\<none\>, false, 0, false, false)\n\ntask decided-of\n  take routes, like list, like route\n  take mark, like text\n  take own, like boolean\n  take view, like refusal-view\n  take words, like list, like text\n  like text\n  save ask, make(line-ask, bind(name, \<tool\>), bind(mark, mark), bind(routes, routes), bind(argv, words), bind(words-own, own))\n  back \<[\{join(words, \<][\>)\}] mark \{mark\} own \{own\} =\\\> \{outcome-shown(decide(ask), view)\}\>\n\ntask case-of\n  take routes, like list, like route\n  take mark, like text\n  take words, like list, like text\n  like text\n  back decided-of(routes, mark, false, plain-view(), words)\n\ntask run\n  like text\n  save routes, routes-of()\n  save m, \<1.2.0\>\n  save lines, make list\n  # a console that words its own refusal is handed it as data, for a parse error and a missing take\n  save simple, plain-view()\n  lines/push decided-of(routes, m, true, simple, make list(\<frobnicate\>))\n  lines/push decided-of(routes, m, true, simple, make list(\<greet\>))\n  lines/push decided-of(routes, m, true, simple, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--mode\>, \<x\>))\n  # the refusal in each view: color, a nested run, the JSON log, sentences, CI annotations\n  save ansi, view-of(\<ansi\>, false, 0, false, false)\n  save truecolor, view-of(\<truecolor\>, false, 0, false, false)\n  save nested, view-of(\<none\>, false, 2, false, false)\n  save logged, view-of(\<none\>, false, 0, true, false)\n  save spoken, view-of(\<none\>, false, 0, false, true)\n  save noted, view-of(\<none\>, true, 0, false, false)\n  lines/push decided-of(routes, m, false, ansi, make list(\<gret\>))\n  lines/push decided-of(routes, m, false, truecolor, make list(\<greet\>))\n  lines/push decided-of(routes, m, false, nested, make list(\<gret\>))\n  lines/push decided-of(routes, m, false, logged, make list(\<gret\>))\n  lines/push decided-of(routes, m, false, spoken, make list(\<greet\>))\n  lines/push decided-of(routes, \<\>, false, noted, make list(\<gret\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list)\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<--help\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<-h\>, \<greet\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<greet\>, \<--help\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<--version\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<-v\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, \<\>, make list(\<-v\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, \<\>, make list(\<--version\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<frobnicate\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<gret\>, \<bob\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, \<\>, make list(\<cont\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<-q\>, \<nope\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<greet\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--level\>, \<7\>, \<-q\>, \<--loud\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--times\>, \<x\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<greet\>, \<bob\>, \<--zzz\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<count\>, \<a\>, \<b\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<count\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<count\>, \<--\>, \<--help\>, \<z\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<pair\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<pair\>, \<--tag\>, \<t\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<pair\>, \<--tag\>, \<t\>, \<--ratio\>, \<.5\>, \<--label\>, \<l\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<box\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<box\>, \<inner\>, \<--x\>, \<y\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<box\>, \<--help\>))\n  lines/push case-of(routes, m, make list(\<hollow\>))\n  back join(lines, \<\\n\>)\n>

