 Missing a required argument of tool greet. missing required \<name\> - who to greet\n\nraw err: failed: tool The command line was not understood, 1.23s. next tool greet --help\n\n[gret] mark  own false =\> refuse 2 (3+2)\nraw err: ● tool ~/work\n  tool\n\nraw err: ✗ tool There is no command named gret\n\nraw out: ::error title=tool::There is no command named gret\n\nraw err: ✗ tool The command line was not understood\n  22:13:21.234 · 1.23s\n  next tool greet\n\nraw out: ::error title=tool::The command line was not understood\n\n[] mark 1.2.0 own false =\> said 2 (1)\nline out: tool [command]\n\nCommands:\n  tool greet \<name\>     Greet someone\n  tool count [words..]  Count words\n  tool pair             Two takes\n  tool box              A group\n  tool hollow           Nothing bound\n\nOptions:\n  -q, --quiet  Print less                                              [boolean]\n[--help] mark 1.2.0 own false =\> said 0 (1)\nline out: tool [command]\n\nCommands:\n  tool greet \<name\>     Greet someone\n  tool count [words..]  Count words\n  tool pair             Two takes\n  tool box              A group\n  tool hollow           Nothing bound\n\nOptions:\n  -q, --quiet  Print less                                              [boolean]\n[-h][greet] mark 1.2.0 own false =\> said 0 (1)\nline out: tool greet \<name\>\n\nGreet someone\n\nPositionals:\n  name  who to greet                                         [string] [required]\n\nOptions:\n  -q, --quiet  Print less                                              [boolean]\n      --times  how many times                              [number] [default: 1]\n      --level  how deep                                                 [number]\n      --loud                                                           [boolean]\n[greet][--help] mark 1.2.0 own false =\> said 0 (1)\nline out: tool greet \<name\>\n\nGreet someone\n\nPositionals:\n  name  who to greet                                         [string] [required]\n\nOptions:\n  -q, --quiet  Print less                                              [boolean]\n      --times  how many times                              [number] [default: 1]\n      --level  how deep                                                 [number]\n      --loud                                                           [boolean]\n[--version] mark 1.2.0 own false =\> said 0 (1)\nline out: 1.2.0\n[-v] mark 1.2.0 own false =\> said 0 (1)\nline out: 1.2.0\n[-v] mark  own false =\> refuse 2 (2+1)\nraw err: ● tool ~/work\n  tool\n\nraw err: ✗ tool Unknown command "-v"\n\nraw err: ✗ tool The command line was not understood\n  22:13:21.234 · 1.23s\n  next tool --help\n\n[--version] mark  own false =\> refuse 2 (2+1)\nraw err: ● tool ~/work\n  tool\n\nraw err: ✗ tool Unknown command "--version"\n\nraw err: ✗ tool The command line was not understood\n  22:13:21.234 · 1.23s\n  next tool --help\n\n[frobnicate] mark 1.2.0 own false =\> refuse 2 (2+1)\nraw err: ● tool ~/work\n  tool 1.2.0\n\nraw err: ✗ tool There is no command named frobnicate\n\nraw err: ✗ tool The command line was not understood\n  22:13:21.234 · 1.23s\n  next tool, for the list of commands\n\n[gret][bob] mark 1.2.0 own false =\> refuse 2 (2+1)\nraw err: ● tool ~/work\n  tool 1.2.0\n\nraw err: ✗ tool There is no command named gret\n\nraw err: ✗ tool The command line was not understood\n  22:13:21.234 · 1.23s\n  next tool greet\n\n[cont] mark  own false =\> refuse 2 (2+1)\nraw err: ● tool ~/work\n  tool\n\nraw err: ✗ tool There is no command named cont\n\nraw err: ✗ tool The command line was not understood\n  22:13:21.234 · 1.23s\n  next tool count\n\n[-q][nope] mark 1.2.0 own false =\> refuse 2 (2+1)\nraw err: ● tool ~/work\n  tool 1.2.0\n\nraw err: ✗ tool There is no command named nope\n\nraw err: ✗ tool The command line was not understood\n  22:13:21.234 · 1.23s\n  next tool, for the list of commands\n\n[greet] mark 1.2.0 own false =\> refuse 2 (2+1)\nraw err: ● tool ~/work\n  tool 1.2.0\n\nraw err: ✗ tool Mi